        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "All CarMax used car stores provide vehicle repair service, including repairs of vehicles covered by the ESPs we sell.",
        "start_character": 19192,
        "end_character": 19309
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001170010-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001170010-26-000021-42d3cdbbfdcb4e38",
        "accession_number": "0001170010-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "CAF allows us to manage our reliance on third-party finance providers and to leverage knowledge of our business to provide qualifying customers a competitive financing option.",
        "start_character": 10566,
        "end_character": 10741
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001170010-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001170010-26-000021-42d3cdbbfdcb4e38",
        "accession_number": "0001170010-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In every state in which we operate, we must obtain licenses and permits to conduct business, which generally include dealer, service, sales, transportation and finance licenses issued by state and local regulatory authorities.",
        "start_character": 33420,
        "end_character": 33646
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001170010-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001170010-26-000021-42d3cdbbfdcb4e38",
        "accession_number": "0001170010-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business is supported by digital and mobile technologies that provide enhanced customer experience while enabling highly integrated automation of all operating functions, including receiving, appraisals, cataloging, reconditioning, merchandising, shopping, financing, sale and delivery.",
        "start_character": 24811,
        "end_character": 25101
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001170010-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001170010-26-000021-42d3cdbbfdcb4e38",
        "accession_number": "0001170010-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also one of the nation’s largest operators of wholesale vehicle auctions, with 538,203 vehicles sold during fiscal 2026, and one of the nation’s largest providers of used vehicle financing, servicing approximately 1.0 million customer accounts in our $16.37 billion portfolio of auto loans as of February 28, 2026.",
        "start_character": 419,
        "end_character": 740
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001170010-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001170010-26-000021-42d3cdbbfdcb4e38",
        "accession_number": "0001170010-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide customers with a range of other related products and services, including extended protection plan (“EPP”) products and vehicle repair service.",
        "start_character": 9615,
        "end_character": 9768
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001170010-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001170010-26-000021-42d3cdbbfdcb4e38",
        "accession_number": "0001170010-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, through our systematic integrations with our third-party finance partners, we are able to provide our finance-based shopping experience.",
        "start_character": 25851,
        "end_character": 26000
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001170010-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001170010-26-000021-42d3cdbbfdcb4e38",
        "accession_number": "0001170010-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The EPPs that we sell have been designed to our specifications and are administered by the third parties through private-label arrangements.",
        "start_character": 17331,
        "end_character": 17471
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001170010-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001170010-26-000021-42d3cdbbfdcb4e38",
        "accession_number": "0001170010-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Unlike many other auto auctions, we own all the vehicles that we sell in our auctions, which allows us to maintain a high auction sales rate.",
        "start_character": 7155,
        "end_character": 7296
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001170010-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001170010-26-000021-42d3cdbbfdcb4e38",
        "accession_number": "0001170010-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are willing to pay a fee to Tier 3 providers because we believe their participation provides us with incremental sales by enabling customers to secure financing that they may not otherwise be able to obtain.",
        "start_character": 20896,
        "end_character": 21106
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001170010-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001170010-26-000021-42d3cdbbfdcb4e38",
        "accession_number": "0001170010-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe this evolution in our workforce has been and will continue to be critical to the development of our technology platforms and strategic initiatives.",
        "start_character": 30855,
        "end_character": 31013
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001170010-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001170010-26-000021-42d3cdbbfdcb4e38",
        "accession_number": "0001170010-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We employ additional associates during peak selling seasons.",
        "start_character": 29881,
